OL,3,GNEWSABus operator commits to
OL,4,Agovernment's #2 bus cap
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large Herefordshire bus operator has
OL,7,Fconfirmed it will bring in the
OL,8,Fgovernment's #2 fare cap from the start
OL,9,Fof next year, following criticism from
OL,10,Fcounty chiefs and campaigners.
OL,12,FThere had been concern that Sargeants
OL,13,FBrothers, along with Yeomans Travel,
OL,14,Fwould opt out of the centrally
OL,15,Fsubsidised travel scheme, announced by
OL,16,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham in July.
OL,18,FHowever, Sargeants has now said it does
OL,19,Fintend to offer the cheaper fares from
OL,20,FJanuary.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
