OL,3,GNEWSABus operator commits to
OL,4,Agovernment's #2 bus cap
OL,5,
OL,6,FManaging director Matt Evans said: "We
OL,7,Fhave decided to take part in the
OL,8,Fscheme, despite having no scheme
OL,9,Fdetails, as it is our hope that
OL,10,Fparticipating will ease the
OL,11,Fcost-of-living burden and stimulate bus
OL,12,Fpatronage in Herefordshire."
